    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/3ccbed5c425a1af434c9d2e83f1b4a41.poster.avif?t=1751477967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/3ccbed5c425a1af434c9d2e83f1b4a41.webm?t=1751477967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROGUELITE ON RAILS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Train brings classic roguelite design to the tracks with fast-paced duels, branching paths, and floor-based progression packed with bosses, special events, and escalating stakes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is a strategic loop of resource management, risk-reward decisions, and deck refinement as you unlock powerful cards, new characters, and upgrades in the evolving metagame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/378aeb489e53b58f90881dae6a53d0c6.poster.avif?t=1751477967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/378aeb489e53b58f90881dae6a53d0c6.webm?t=1751477967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LINES OF TRACK, LINES OF FIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Battle Train, strategy isn't just in your hand, it\u2019s under your wheels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect your tracks to your opponents\u2019 outposts and blast them before they do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every piece of track matters: special rails boost your trains, barricades slow down enemies, and bombs can swing the tide with a single move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Positioning is power, but so is control. Claim resource mines for turn-based income, steal enemy tracks to cut their flow, or detonate their plans with explosive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/adffc7da95c8c478208707582f130bf5.poster.avif?t=1751477967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/adffc7da95c8c478208707582f130bf5.webm?t=1751477967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOOSE MAYHEM </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt your playstyle in every run and then push it further, with evolving card rewards and powerful upgrades that shape your strategy turn by turn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your train is a full-blown war machine built from swappable parts, each offering unique stat boosts, passive effects, mineral gains, or disruptive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/5d96c29a676ce28319e59c8c1ba5bfe7.poster.avif?t=1751477967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/5d96c29a676ce28319e59c8c1ba5bfe7.webm?t=1751477967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOIN THE MOST CHAOTIC GAMESHOW EVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a contender, you\u2019ll face a madcap gauntlet of rival Champions, explosive challenges, and surprise rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet eccentric hosts, unlock unexpected lore, and witness the downfall of Supreme Champion Aalvado.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're in it for the 15-hour story mode or 100+ hours of replayability, Battle Train is a tale of redemption, rivalry, and rekindling your creative passion\u2026 through destruction!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/3ccbed5c425a1af434c9d2e83f1b4a41.poster.avif?t=1751477967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/3ccbed5c425a1af434c9d2e83f1b4a41.webm?t=1751477967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ROGUELITE ON RAILS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Train brings classic roguelite design to the tracks with fast-paced duels, branching paths, and floor-based progression packed with bosses, special events, and escalating stakes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is a strategic loop of resource management, risk-reward decisions, and deck refinement as you unlock powerful cards, new characters, and upgrades in the evolving metagame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/378aeb489e53b58f90881dae6a53d0c6.poster.avif?t=1751477967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/378aeb489e53b58f90881dae6a53d0c6.webm?t=1751477967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LINES OF TRACK, LINES OF FIRE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Battle Train, strategy isn't just in your hand, it\u2019s under your wheels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect your tracks to your opponents\u2019 outposts and blast them before they do the same to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every piece of track matters: special rails boost your trains, barricades slow down enemies, and bombs can swing the tide with a single move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Positioning is power, but so is control. Claim resource mines for turn-based income, steal enemy tracks to cut their flow, or detonate their plans with explosive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/adffc7da95c8c478208707582f130bf5.poster.avif?t=1751477967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/adffc7da95c8c478208707582f130bf5.webm?t=1751477967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOOSE MAYHEM </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt your playstyle in every run and then push it further, with evolving card rewards and powerful upgrades that shape your strategy turn by turn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your train is a full-blown war machine built from swappable parts, each offering unique stat boosts, passive effects, mineral gains, or disruptive abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/5d96c29a676ce28319e59c8c1ba5bfe7.poster.avif?t=1751477967\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1708950/extras/5d96c29a676ce28319e59c8c1ba5bfe7.webm?t=1751477967\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">JOIN THE MOST CHAOTIC GAMESHOW EVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a contender, you\u2019ll face a madcap gauntlet of rival Champions, explosive challenges, and surprise rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet eccentric hosts, unlock unexpected lore, and witness the downfall of Supreme Champion Aalvado.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're in it for the 15-hour story mode or 100+ hours of replayability, Battle Train is a tale of redemption, rivalry, and rekindling your creative passion\u2026 through destruction!</p>",
    "short_description": "Battle Train is a run-based roguelite deck-n-track builder set in the world\u2019s most explosive game show. Choose your cards, upgrade your train, lay down tracks, and use destructive locomotives to blast your rival Champions off the rails in a chaotic mashup of deck-building and tactical rail combat.",
